<title>USA: ENSERCH Corp sets spin-off record date.</title>
<headline>ENSERCH Corp sets spin-off record date.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>ENSERCH Corp said it has set April 11 as the record date for shares of Enserch Exploration Inc to be distributed to shareholders.</p>
<p>It said if the Securities and Exchange Commission has not approved closing of the ENSERCH and Texas Utilities Co merger by then, the record date will be extended.</p>
</text>
